      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.33,
          "end": 2.43,
          "en": "Now to use this custom header component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 2.43,
          "end": 4.98,
          "en": "we could go to the index HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 4.98,
          "end": 8.37,
          "en": "where we're also using this app root component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 8.37,
          "end": 9.81,
          "en": "so the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 9.81,
          "end": 13.29,
          "en": "and there we could add app dash header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 13.29,
          "end": 15.243,
          "en": "opening and closing like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 16.68,
          "end": 19.2,
          "en": "If you would save this though,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 19.2,
          "end": 22.62,
          "en": "you would see no difference on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 22.62,
          "end": 24.21,
          "en": "There, you would not see",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 24.21,
          "end": 27.93,
          "en": "that new header component markup that we set up.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 27.93,
          "end": 30,
          "en": "It's nowhere to be found here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 30,
          "end": 32.97,
          "en": "Also not if we inspect this page here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 32.97,
          "end": 34.47,
          "en": "and the rendered elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 34.47,
          "end": 37.62,
          "en": "There, indeed we would see app header,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 37.62,
          "end": 40.08,
          "en": "but it would be an empty HTML element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 40.08,
          "end": 41.76,
          "en": "that doesn't do anything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 41.76,
          "end": 44.28,
          "en": "because the browser doesn't recognize it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 44.28,
          "end": 47.13,
          "en": "and Angular actually ignores it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 47.13,
          "end": 49.29,
          "en": "because what's important to understand",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 49.29,
          "end": 52.41,
          "en": "as an Angular developer is that Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 52.41,
          "end": 55.5,
          "en": "is not automatically scanning all your files",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 55.5,
          "end": 57.81,
          "en": "and folders and looking for components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 57.81,
          "end": 59.76,
          "en": "you might be defining.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 59.76,
          "end": 62.82,
          "en": "Instead, you have to explicitly tell Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 62.82,
          "end": 65.943,
          "en": "if you have a new component and you wanna use it somewhere.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 66.78,
          "end": 70.74,
          "en": "And that's for example, what's happening in the main.ts file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 70.74,
          "end": 73.623,
          "en": "with help of that bootstrap application function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 74.97,
          "end": 78.81,
          "en": "This function tells Angular that there is an app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 78.81,
          "end": 82.62,
          "en": "and that it should look for this component's tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 82.62,
          "end": 84.84,
          "en": "in the index HTML file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 84.84,
          "end": 88.143,
          "en": "to display the content of this component on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 89.19,
          "end": 91.47,
          "en": "Therefore, what we could of course do",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 91.47,
          "end": 94.65,
          "en": "is also call bootstrap application",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 94.65,
          "end": 97.773,
          "en": "and pass our header component to it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 98.61,
          "end": 101.61,
          "en": "We would simply import header component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 101.61,
          "end": 105.99000000000001,
          "en": "our class from this header component TypeScript file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 105.99000000000001,
          "end": 108.99000000000001,
          "en": "without the extension as you learned,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 108.99000000000001,
          "end": 112.65299999999999,
          "en": "and pass it to another bootstrap application call.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 114.09,
          "end": 116.52000000000001,
          "en": "If you would do that and you save everything,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 116.52000000000001,
          "end": 120,
          "en": "you would indeed see that now the headers component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 120,
          "end": 121.71,
          "en": "is visible on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 121.71,
          "end": 123.81,
          "en": "So now Angular is aware of it",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 123.81,
          "end": 127.473,
          "en": "and finds its tag and renders its content.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 128.7,
          "end": 132,
          "en": "However, this is typically not how you would render",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 132,
          "end": 136.29,
          "en": "this component because the idea with Angular in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 136.29,
          "end": 139.92000000000002,
          "en": "is that you build a tree of components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 139.92000000000002,
          "end": 142.07999999999998,
          "en": "where you have one component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 142.07999999999998,
          "end": 146.57999999999998,
          "en": "the root component typically the app component at the top,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 146.57999999999998,
          "end": 148.71,
          "en": "and then you have other components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 148.71,
          "end": 150.93,
          "en": "nested inside of that component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 150.93,
          "end": 153.66,
          "en": "or nested inside of other components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 153.66,
          "end": 157.62,
          "en": "And this is not just some arbitrary design decision",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 157.62,
          "end": 159.66,
          "en": "made by the Angular team.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 159.66,
          "end": 164.01,
          "en": "Instead, the idea behind building such a component tree",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 164.01,
          "end": 168.06,
          "en": "is that those components that are part of the same tree,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 168.06,
          "end": 170.94,
          "en": "part of the same Angular application,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.94,
          "end": 174.24,
          "en": "therefore will be able to work together",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 174.24,
          "end": 177.09,
          "en": "and exchange data for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 177.09,
          "end": 179.34,
          "en": "and communicate with each other,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 179.34,
          "end": 182.01,
          "en": "something you'll learn about in depth",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 182.01,
          "end": 184.08,
          "en": "throughout this course.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 184.08,
          "end": 186.69,
          "en": "And therefore the idea is that you would typically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 186.69,
          "end": 189.48,
          "en": "only call bootstrap application once",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 189.48,
          "end": 192.39,
          "en": "with that one main root component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 192.39,
          "end": 195.42,
          "en": "and then you use any other components",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 195.42,
          "end": 197.94,
          "en": "in that components template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 197.94,
          "end": 201.243,
          "en": "or in templates of other nested components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 202.35,
          "end": 205.82999999999998,
          "en": "So we would use our header component here inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 205.82999999999998,
          "end": 207.75,
          "en": "of the template of the app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 207.75,
          "end": 208.923,
          "en": "That's the idea.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 209.82,
          "end": 213.3,
          "en": "For example, we could replace this dummy header here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 213.3,
          "end": 216.51,
          "en": "of that starting page I prepared for you",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 216.51,
          "end": 221.17000000000002,
          "en": "with our app dash header custom component tag",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 222.36,
          "end": 224.94,
          "en": "because that is the tag we're looking for",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 224.94,
          "end": 229.35,
          "en": "because of this selector, app dash header.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 229.35,
          "end": 231.09,
          "en": "That's what I'm now using here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 231.09,
          "end": 234.933,
          "en": "as an element in the app components HTML file.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 236.07,
          "end": 239.01,
          "en": "However, if you add this here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 239.01,
          "end": 241.5,
          "en": "you'll see that now you'll get an error.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 241.5,
          "end": 243.81,
          "en": "If you take a look at this terminal",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 243.81,
          "end": 246.45,
          "en": "where you started the development server",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 246.45,
          "end": 251.07,
          "en": "by running NPM start, you see that there you get an error",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 251.07,
          "end": 254.553,
          "en": "that app dash header is not a known element.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 255.48,
          "end": 257.73,
          "en": "And again, the reason for that is that Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 257.73,
          "end": 260.37,
          "en": "doesn't scan all your files and folders",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 260.37,
          "end": 263.19,
          "en": "and automatically register components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 263.19,
          "end": 266.22,
          "en": "Instead as mentioned, you have to inform Angular",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 266.22,
          "end": 268.09,
          "en": "about any components you created",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 269.16,
          "end": 272.7,
          "en": "and you do that when using a component inside",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 272.7,
          "end": 276.06,
          "en": "of another components template as we're doing it here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 276.06,
          "end": 280.68,
          "en": "by going to the component in which template you are using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 280.68,
          "end": 281.79,
          "en": "another component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 281.79,
          "end": 283.35,
          "en": "So in this case the app component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 283.35,
          "end": 284.61,
          "en": "because it's the template",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 284.61,
          "end": 287.1,
          "en": "of the app component in which we are using",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 287.1,
          "end": 288.36,
          "en": "another component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 288.36,
          "end": 291.24,
          "en": "And you then register that other component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 291.24,
          "end": 294.69,
          "en": "you wanna use in this component's template.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 294.69,
          "end": 297.63,
          "en": "And that's done by importing that other component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 297.63,
          "end": 299.62,
          "en": "So in this case the header component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 300.75,
          "end": 303.57,
          "en": "from this component's file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 303.57,
          "end": 306.573,
          "en": "so header.component without the file extension,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 307.89,
          "end": 310.92,
          "en": "and then you add it to this imports property,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 310.92,
          "end": 313.2,
          "en": "which you also find on this app component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 313.2,
          "end": 316.89,
          "en": "configuration object because this configuration",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 316.89,
          "end": 320.34,
          "en": "in the end works together with this standalone feature",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 320.34,
          "end": 323.97,
          "en": "such that it registers all the things,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 323.97,
          "end": 327.06,
          "en": "all the standalone components, for example,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 327.06,
          "end": 330.483,
          "en": "that you wanna use in the template of this app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 331.53,
          "end": 335.31,
          "en": "So you simply pass header component like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 335.31,
          "end": 340.31,
          "en": "to this imports array and that now unlocks this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 340.62,
          "end": 343.203,
          "en": "for the template of this app component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 344.4,
          "end": 347.82,
          "en": "And therefore with this done, if you now save this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 347.82,
          "end": 350.01,
          "en": "and you have this development server up and running,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 350.01,
          "end": 353.85,
          "en": "it should automatically reload and re-execute your code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 353.85,
          "end": 355.59000000000003,
          "en": "Now the error should be gone",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 355.59000000000003,
          "end": 358.26,
          "en": "and you should now see that content on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 358.26,
          "end": 362.13,
          "en": "but now it's loaded in the way you typically would load",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 362.13,
          "end": 365.22,
          "en": "and render other components by adding them",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 365.22,
          "end": 366.873,
          "en": "to your component tree.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}
